{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41587","headline":"纳省卷赠爲首刘象 · 沈彬","name":"纳省卷赠爲首刘象","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾应大中天子举，四朝风月鬓萧疎。\n不随世祖重携劒，却爲文皇再读书。\n十载战尘销旧业，满城春雨坏贫居。\n一枝何事於君借，仙桂年年幸有余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}